**pratical 12**

**Summary**
The Travelling Salesman Problem (TSP) finds the minimum-cost route to visit every city exactly once and return to the starting city.

**Conclusion**
Thus, the Travelling Salesman Problem was implemented successfully in Python using permutations to find the optimal route and its minimum cost.

Time Complexity: \(O(n!)\)

Space Complexity: \(O(n)\) auxiliary space, excluding the input matrix.
